{"rank": 206, "root": "سمع", "form": 8, "lemma": "اسْتَمَعَ", "count": 16, "ayahCount": 15, "share": 0.08, "meaning": {"bs": "slušati, pažljivo slušati", "en": "to listen", "tr": "dinlemek, kulak vermek", "fr": "écouter", "id": "mendengarkan", "ur": "کان لگانا، سننا", "bn": "মনোযোগ দিয়ে শোনা", "fa": "گوش دادن"}, "lemmaSpoken": "audio/ab1daa0c07259328a8d0.m4a", "animation": "<svg class=\"va va-istamaa_8\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 72\"><style> @keyframes istamaa_8-t{from{transform:rotate(0)}}.va-istamaa_8 .l .tr{transform:rotate(12deg);animation:istamaa_8-t 1s ease-out both}.va-istamaa_8 .l .ll{transform:rotate(-88deg)}.va-istamaa_8 .l .rl{transform:rotate(-84deg)}.va-istamaa_8 .l .la{transform:rotate(-30deg)}.va-istamaa_8 .l .ra{transform:rotate(-20deg)}.va-istamaa_8 .l .ra{transform:rotate(-150deg)}@keyframes istamaa_8-v{from{opacity:0}}.va-istamaa_8 .v0{animation:istamaa_8-v .45s ease-out 3 both}.va-istamaa_8 .v1{animation:istamaa_8-v .45s ease-out .2s 3 both}.va-istamaa_8 .v2{animation:istamaa_8-v .45s ease-out .4s 3 both}.f,.p{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.f{stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:4.5}.t{stroke-width:8}.h{fill:var(--accent)}.p{stroke:var(--gold);stroke-width:3}.q{fill:var(--gold)}.va-istamaa_8.off,.va-istamaa_8.off *{animation:none!important}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.va-istamaa_8,.va-istamaa_8 *{animation:none!important}}</style><path class=\"p\" d=\"M6 61H114M24 56h22\"/><path class=\"p v0\" d=\"M80 15q-3 3 0 6\"/><path class=\"p v1\" d=\"M74 12q-5 6 0 12\"/><path class=\"p v2\" d=\"M68 9q-7 9 0 18\"/><g class=\"l\"><g transform=\"translate(34 56)\"><g class=\"fig\"><g class=\"ll\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"rl\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"tr\"><path class=\"f t\" d=\"M0 0V-17\"/><circle class=\"h\" cy=\"-26\" r=\"6.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"la\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"